WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.160 --> 00:07.240
- [Previously…] - The feud between the two families

3
00:07.443 --> 00:10.600
started with Wirat and Sirin, your mother.

4
00:11.214 --> 00:13.840
We're going to run away together.

5
00:13.939 --> 00:16.280
And Yi really knows about this, right?

6
00:17.840 --> 00:19.160
He already promised Tokyo he'd help us.

7
00:19.352 --> 00:21.680
You've got me. What are you scared of?

8
00:22.408 --> 00:24.080
Tell me how my dad died.

9
00:25.726 --> 00:27.320
But Yi's really coming, right?

10
00:28.211 --> 00:29.880
Yi would never break his promise to us.

11
00:40.576 --> 00:45.400
I confess to almighty God

12
00:45.702 --> 00:46.840
and to you, my brothers and sisters,

13
00:48.107 --> 00:51.760
that I have greatly sinned

14
00:52.990 --> 00:56.920
in my thoughts and in my words,

15
00:58.552 --> 00:59.720
in what I have done and what I have failed to do.

16
01:03.520 --> 01:04.680
I have sinned.

17
01:07.363 --> 01:08.760
I admit

18
01:09.283 --> 01:10.284
that I am a sinner.

19
01:21.622 --> 01:23.720
Dad! Dad!

20
01:24.710 --> 01:25.880
What happened?

21
01:27.220 --> 01:28.560
I've sent my men to look for them.

22
01:32.048 --> 01:33.049
Look for who, Big?

23
01:35.049 --> 01:36.050
Who did this to Yi?

24
01:45.936 --> 01:48.576
Doctor, how is my son?

25
01:58.123 --> 01:59.124
That’s our rule, remember?

26
01:59.568 --> 02:01.210
Secret for secret.

27
02:02.192 --> 02:03.600
Next time, just tell me.

28
02:04.331 --> 02:06.250
It’ll be our little secret. I won’t tell Dad.

29
02:12.300 --> 02:13.760
Do you really want to go abroad that badly?

30
02:17.158 --> 02:18.159
Fine.

31
02:18.590 --> 02:19.631
I’ll talk to Dad for you.

32
02:21.160 --> 02:22.520
- You will? - Yeah.

33
02:23.174 --> 02:25.160
Make sure you find out what your dream is.

34
02:26.400 --> 02:28.520
And stop thinking I’m so mean.

35
02:29.104 --> 02:30.805
I love you more than anyone in this family, dumbass.

36
02:32.438 --> 02:34.920
I think you and your girlfriend should get out of this town as soon as you can.

37
02:35.334 --> 02:38.240
I have a feeling our family and theirs are going to clash sooner or later.

38
02:38.638 --> 02:40.520
And I don't want you getting caught up in this because of me again.

39
02:42.248 --> 02:45.040
You've got me. What are you scared of?

40
02:55.139 --> 02:56.360
What do you mean, Doctor?

41
02:57.960 --> 03:01.100
Go get the best doctor you can find to save my child!

42
03:01.416 --> 03:02.417
Go!

43
03:02.579 --> 03:04.894
Yi has lost a lot of blood.

44
03:06.691 --> 03:08.560
What kind of blood do you need, huh?

45
03:09.400 --> 03:12.080
Take Big's blood! Take all of his blood!

46
03:12.163 --> 03:13.164
Just take it!

47
03:14.050 --> 03:16.880
- Hurry! Take it! - There's nothing more we can do.

48
03:18.104 --> 03:19.440
Yi has passed away.

49
03:25.536 --> 03:26.600
Don't you dare tell me

50
03:27.414 --> 03:29.100
that my son is dead.

51
03:30.027 --> 03:31.360
Don't you fucking dare say that!

52
03:31.544 --> 03:33.480
You bastard! Don't you dare say it!

53
03:40.528 --> 03:42.040
Get up, it's okay.

54
04:21.760 --> 04:23.100
Why the hell are you doing this?

55
04:26.811 --> 04:28.160
Yi killed my dad.

56
04:39.635 --> 04:42.350
I asked her to help Phu with the insurance paperwork.

57
04:42.960 --> 04:44.720
She gets a little extra for helping out.

58
06:11.982 --> 06:13.102
Are you ready, honey?

59
06:13.288 --> 06:15.160
Pakkard, you have to leave right now.

60
06:16.568 --> 06:18.392
- Pakkard, honey! - Where is she going, Mom?

61
06:20.169 --> 06:22.600
Anywhere. Just get as far away as possible.

62
06:22.886 --> 06:24.280
She can even leave the province.

63
06:26.288 --> 06:27.289
Pakkard, are you okay, honey?

64
06:28.054 --> 06:29.960
Go on. Trust me, honey.

65
06:37.187 --> 06:38.360
I'm sorry, Blue.

66
06:41.094 --> 06:42.300
But I've already done it.

67
06:47.472 --> 06:48.473
Please, this way.

68
07:06.896 --> 07:08.480
Dad, was Pakkard telling the truth?

69
07:10.347 --> 07:11.960
Did Yi really kill Uncle Wirat?

70
07:14.800 --> 07:15.801
Yes.

71
07:21.000 --> 07:23.640
Then why did you tell Pakkard about it?

72
07:27.582 --> 07:28.960
You were trying to trick her...

73
07:30.276 --> 07:34.120
You used her to settle that stupid feud between our families, didn't you?

74
07:36.211 --> 07:38.812
You said she was like another daughter to you!

75
07:39.704 --> 07:41.735
How could you do this to her?

76
07:44.540 --> 07:47.320
You're my only child.

77
07:51.523 --> 07:53.880
I know you're not exactly a good person, Dad.

78
07:57.376 --> 07:59.424
But how can you be such an asshole?

79
08:03.000 --> 08:04.507
Why should I keep it from her?

80
08:05.856 --> 08:06.857
Sooner or later,

81
08:07.456 --> 08:09.157
Pakkard would've found out anyway.

82
08:09.984 --> 08:11.307
I just told her the truth.

83
08:12.048 --> 08:13.049
As for everything else,

84
08:14.214 --> 08:16.480
Pakkard made her own decisions.

85
08:17.320 --> 08:20.480
Are you sure you told her the truth, Dad?

86
08:24.472 --> 08:27.742
So I guess this gun just magically appeared out of nowhere, huh?

87
08:35.163 --> 08:37.947
Everything has already been decided.

88
08:54.840 --> 08:56.760
You just have to play your part.

89
09:26.083 --> 09:27.400
You killed my son!

90
09:28.350 --> 09:29.351
You fucking bitch!

91
09:31.800 --> 09:33.200
You killed my child!

92
09:38.179 --> 09:39.180
Big!

93
09:40.100 --> 09:41.801
Who killed Yi?

94
09:42.548 --> 09:43.549
Someone from that family.

95
09:44.371 --> 09:45.372
That bitch Pakkard.

96
09:51.040 --> 09:52.240
Go wipe out her entire family!

97
09:53.784 --> 09:56.240
Your stupid family feud

98
09:57.192 --> 09:59.113
has already cost Yi her life!

99
10:00.318 --> 10:01.360
Stop it, Tokyo!

100
10:03.534 --> 10:04.535
No, I won't!

101
10:04.947 --> 10:06.760
You and Dad are the ones who need to stop!

102
10:08.291 --> 10:09.292
I know what happened

103
10:10.414 --> 10:11.920
17 years ago.

104
10:12.766 --> 10:14.120
Pakkard's father died

105
10:14.995 --> 10:17.400
because you ordered Yi to kill him, didn't you?

106
10:19.091 --> 10:21.520
This is exactly why! You keep killing each other!

107
10:22.595 --> 10:24.480
That's why this will never end, Dad!

108
10:25.102 --> 10:27.280
You kill one of them, and they kill one of us!

109
10:27.303 --> 10:28.810
Stop talking about things you know nothing about!

110
10:31.264 --> 10:32.265
What don't I know?

111
10:34.243 --> 10:36.403
If you think I don't know, then tell me the truth!

112
10:36.616 --> 10:37.920
Yi acted on her own.

113
10:41.198 --> 10:42.840
Nobody wanted any of this to happen!

114
10:45.532 --> 10:46.880
Yi did it on his own!

115
10:48.667 --> 10:50.360
No one in this family knew anything about it!

116
10:55.619 --> 10:57.680
But you helped Yi cover up what he did, didn't you?

117
11:00.656 --> 11:02.160
Did you want your brother to go to jail?

118
11:04.712 --> 11:06.320
Do you want everyone in the province to know

119
11:08.030 --> 11:09.670
that our family is full of murderers?

120
11:14.584 --> 11:16.500
I've done the best I could, Tokyo.

121
11:18.104 --> 11:20.600
Yi did what he thought was right, too.

122
11:22.979 --> 11:24.240
What the hell was right about any of this?

123
11:28.485 --> 11:30.486
Yi ended up dead because of it!

124
11:35.627 --> 11:36.628
Dad!

125
11:38.000 --> 11:39.880
How many more people have to die

126
11:40.224 --> 11:41.560
before this finally ends?

127
11:44.315 --> 11:45.316
Dad,

128
11:46.848 --> 11:49.360
let's do the right thing. Please.

129
11:51.750 --> 11:52.751
The right thing?

130
11:55.240 --> 11:56.680
What exactly is the right thing?

131
12:00.739 --> 12:02.200
You're so selfish

132
12:03.700 --> 12:05.500
that you can't even see the truth.

133
12:11.310 --> 12:13.180
That bastard Wirat deceived your mother.

134
12:17.040 --> 12:19.960
Then he planted a bomb in her car and killed her.

135
12:40.840 --> 12:42.741
[Wirat: Sirin, see you at four.]

136
13:00.120 --> 13:01.121
[Po]

137
13:07.776 --> 13:08.960
You're planning to run away, aren't you?

138
13:09.702 --> 13:11.400
You're still thinking of leaving with that bastard Wirat?

139
13:11.880 --> 13:13.960
The Monchaikul family is deceiving you!

140
13:15.046 --> 13:16.320
Just let me go.

141
13:16.774 --> 13:19.782
Sirin, you are not taking Tokyo anywhere!

142
13:48.502 --> 13:49.880
Tokyo, sweetheart.

143
13:50.331 --> 13:52.160
Come start a new life with Mommy, sweetheart.

144
13:52.700 --> 13:53.701
Okay?

145
13:53.990 --> 13:55.991
Uncle Wirat will pick us up soon.

146
14:18.184 --> 14:19.185
Sirin!

147
14:22.766 --> 14:23.767
Tokyo!

148
14:29.320 --> 14:30.321
Tokyo!

149
14:54.224 --> 14:55.225
As for you,

150
14:56.619 --> 14:57.880
you're lucky

151
14:59.822 --> 15:02.000
you survived to stand here and insult me!

152
15:07.870 --> 15:09.920
I never wanted you to know the whole truth.

153
15:11.915 --> 15:12.916
But in the end,

154
15:13.675 --> 15:16.680
raising you without telling you anything

155
15:16.971 --> 15:18.720
only made you more stubborn

156
15:19.540 --> 15:21.254
and left you vulnerable to their lies!

157
15:23.248 --> 15:24.560
Do you still love her?

158
15:26.230 --> 15:28.680
Even though her family

159
15:29.323 --> 15:30.324
killed your mother with their own hands?

160
15:33.781 --> 15:36.640
Do you still believe in your pure, innocent love?

161
15:38.880 --> 15:40.400
Or do you think your love

162
15:41.720 --> 15:44.600
can somehow wash away your mother's blood that was spilled all those years ago?

163
15:45.321 --> 15:46.322
Huh?

164
15:52.330 --> 15:55.320
Yi may have been wrong

165
15:56.270 --> 15:57.640
to kill someone,

166
15:58.944 --> 16:00.250
but he did the right thing

167
16:01.720 --> 16:04.000
by avenging your mother's death.

168
16:55.720 --> 16:56.840
What more do you want?

169
17:06.592 --> 17:10.400
I don't have a secret room like you and Yi did.

170
17:13.747 --> 17:15.000
So I had to come here.

171
17:17.840 --> 17:19.200
There's something I want to talk to you about.

172
17:24.688 --> 17:26.500
I've been through what you're going through, Tokyo.

173
17:31.160 --> 17:32.520
I was young once, too.

174
17:35.576 --> 17:36.800
I wanted to rebel.

175
17:38.936 --> 17:41.760
I used to long for the day Dad would accept me

176
17:43.107 --> 17:44.208
more than he accepted Yi.

177
18:05.830 --> 18:07.640
That desire to be loved,

178
18:09.814 --> 18:11.880
loving someone with all your heart,

179
18:14.160 --> 18:15.320
I've felt those things, too.

180
18:21.830 --> 18:22.840
But the older I get,

181
18:24.571 --> 18:27.480
the more I realize those feelings don't last forever.

182
18:32.570 --> 18:34.450
What's more important than love

183
18:37.504 --> 18:38.760
is responsibility.

184
19:05.179 --> 19:06.720
There are many paths we can take in life.

185
19:12.048 --> 19:13.049
But I know

186
19:14.971 --> 19:17.110
my little sister will make the right choice.

187
20:24.030 --> 20:26.080
You've heard what happened, haven't you?

188
20:44.707 --> 20:45.708
I'm sorry.

189
20:55.587 --> 20:57.160
What are you apologizing for?

190
21:01.341 --> 21:03.280
I'm apologizing on Pakkard's behalf.

191
21:05.992 --> 21:09.640
I know I shouldn't say this, but I...

192
21:11.107 --> 21:12.900
Can we please not talk about this right now?

193
21:22.600 --> 21:23.601
I know

194
21:24.936 --> 21:26.700
you don't want me to be angry with Pakkard.

195
21:29.500 --> 21:31.150
I can't tell you how to feel.

196
21:33.763 --> 21:35.360
What happened was too serious.

197
21:37.080 --> 21:38.840
You can be angry or furious.

198
21:39.208 --> 21:41.309
You have every right to feel however you want.

199
21:42.227 --> 21:43.960
I won't hold any of that against you.

200
21:46.339 --> 21:47.340
It's just that...

201
21:49.726 --> 21:52.880
I want you to know that between us,

202
21:55.195 --> 21:56.600
nothing has changed.

203
22:03.643 --> 22:05.720
I'm just not ready to talk about this right now.

204
22:18.646 --> 22:21.000
My family is looking for Pakkard right now.

205
22:24.248 --> 22:25.720
Pakkard isn't here anymore.

206
22:26.387 --> 22:29.320
My parents helped her escape to the border.

207
22:30.680 --> 22:32.300
I don't know how she's doing now.

208
22:35.795 --> 22:37.880
So you helped Pakkard escape, too?

209
22:44.531 --> 22:45.532
I...

210
23:00.016 --> 23:02.758
Pakkard killed my brother Yi!

211
23:07.899 --> 23:10.400
Didn't you say people who do wrong should be punished?

212
23:14.987 --> 23:16.680
Or is it because she's your friend?

213
23:17.760 --> 23:19.161
So you're just going to let it slide?

214
23:24.075 --> 23:27.076
What happened to all that justice you've been fighting for?

215
23:33.600 --> 23:36.320
But Yi killed Pakkard's father!

216
23:41.160 --> 23:43.600
So that gives her the right to kill him for revenge?

217
24:33.795 --> 24:34.796
I'm sorry.

218
24:36.700 --> 24:37.701
I'm sorry.

219
24:48.875 --> 24:50.120
We won't repeat

220
24:52.480 --> 24:55.440
the same mistakes our parents made, will we?

221
25:13.768 --> 25:15.900
What's going to happen to us now?

222
26:12.979 --> 26:14.400
Who do you think killed Yi?

223
26:15.374 --> 26:18.194
I don't know. But with the kind of life Yi led,

224
26:18.250 --> 26:19.880
it was bound to happen sooner or later.

225
26:20.568 --> 26:23.080
My mom said people at the market are gossiping

226
26:23.100 --> 26:24.360
that Pakkard was the one who did it.

227
26:24.765 --> 26:27.000
Hey, and what about that rumor

228
26:27.246 --> 26:29.800
that Tokyo and Blue are dating? Is it true?

229
26:34.792 --> 26:36.300
What the fuck are you guys talking about?

230
26:56.240 --> 26:57.241
Are you okay?

231
26:59.790 --> 27:01.400
Why the hell does everyone keep asking me that?

232
27:04.291 --> 27:05.440
Am I okay or not?

233
27:07.760 --> 27:09.761
Try going through what I've been through!

234
27:11.115 --> 27:13.120
Let's see if you can still say you're okay!

235
27:18.184 --> 27:19.600
We're just worried about you.

236
27:25.272 --> 27:26.273
Hey...

237
27:29.862 --> 27:30.960
I'm sorry.

238
27:38.160 --> 27:39.240
It's okay.

239
27:41.220 --> 27:42.640
Actually, I think...

240
27:44.150 --> 27:46.120
if you had to choose who to believe,

241
27:49.635 --> 27:51.360
Jai would be more believable than me anyway.

242
27:59.950 --> 28:01.750
But I still owe you an apology.

243
28:07.603 --> 28:09.000
I'm really sorry.

244
28:21.780 --> 28:22.781
Someday,

245
28:25.000 --> 28:26.301
when I'm no longer around,

246
28:29.403 --> 28:31.120
you should have a proper talk with Jai.

247
29:12.614 --> 29:13.880
I was the one who started all of this.

248
29:15.408 --> 29:18.240
So I'll take responsibility for everything I've done.

249
29:24.984 --> 29:27.680
My little sister shouldn't have to inherit this hatred.

250
29:29.528 --> 29:32.250
Tokyo deserves to live the life she wants.

251
30:25.080 --> 30:27.081
[The direct admission results are out.]

252
30:36.040 --> 30:38.041
[List of Students Admitted to Srisilapasat University]

253
30:42.520 --> 30:44.521
[Phakjira Monchaitrakul]

254
30:54.920 --> 30:57.720
Sinittha...Sinittha Kongpurim

255
31:33.568 --> 31:34.569
Congratulations

256
31:35.720 --> 31:36.721
on getting accepted through direct admission.

257
31:39.534 --> 31:40.535
Thanks.

258
31:42.200 --> 31:43.201
Yeah.

259
31:45.027 --> 31:46.984
But your name...

260
31:47.790 --> 31:48.791
Yeah.

261
31:50.136 --> 31:51.200
I couldn't find it on the list.

262
31:52.800 --> 31:54.301
Guess I didn't get in this time.

263
31:58.500 --> 31:59.501
Hey!

264
32:01.350 --> 32:02.351
It's okay.

265
32:03.483 --> 32:04.800
I can go somewhere else.

266
32:07.027 --> 32:08.750
Maybe a private university in Bangkok.

267
32:09.475 --> 32:10.760
There are plenty of good ones.

268
32:19.078 --> 32:20.760
Are you sure your dad won't mind?

269
32:24.480 --> 32:25.600
I don't care anymore.

270
32:36.320 --> 32:38.822
Hello? Where the hell are you?

271
32:39.264 --> 32:40.320
I'm at the border.

272
32:40.939 --> 32:43.600
Once it gets dark, I have to cross over into Myanmar.

273
32:44.043 --> 32:45.560
I probably won't be able to contact you for a long time.

274
32:45.742 --> 32:47.140
So I wanted to call and let you know.

275
32:51.011 --> 32:54.280
Don't worry about me. Just focus on keeping yourself safe, okay?

276
32:54.670 --> 32:56.056
Once you make it across,

277
32:56.100 --> 32:57.920
just call me when you're safe.

278
32:58.910 --> 33:01.064
Yeah. Thanks so much.

279
33:01.416 --> 33:02.880
I'm really sorry, Blue.

280
33:10.342 --> 33:11.343
Are you leaving?

281
33:12.379 --> 33:13.380
Yeah.

282
33:14.918 --> 33:17.800
I have to help with Yi's funeral arrangements tonight.

283
33:21.302 --> 33:24.560
Besides, I don't want any more trouble right now.

284
33:29.230 --> 33:30.231
I should get going.

285
34:02.592 --> 34:05.147
I don't know why she did it,

286
34:06.000 --> 34:07.201
But I can assure you

287
34:07.331 --> 34:10.180
that I absolutely do not condone my niece's actions.

288
34:10.674 --> 34:14.250
And where is Pakkard now?

289
34:15.880 --> 34:16.881
I don't know.

290
34:17.614 --> 34:18.615
Are you sure?

291
34:20.104 --> 34:22.800
It's hard to believe one girl could pull off such a brazen attack on the Kongpurim family.

292
34:23.939 --> 34:25.320
I find that highly unlikely.

293
34:27.853 --> 34:29.380
Anything is possible, Inspector.

294
34:30.398 --> 34:32.350
They hurt us, we hurt them.

295
34:33.475 --> 34:34.480
You know as well as I do

296
34:35.059 --> 34:36.900
that this cycle has been going on for years.

297
34:39.422 --> 34:40.640
Anyway, this time,

298
34:41.480 --> 34:44.500
I'll cooperate fully with your investigation.

299
34:45.373 --> 34:48.360
After all, whoever is guilty must be punished.

300
34:51.432 --> 34:54.240
If anything happens to my niece in the future,

301
34:55.363 --> 34:58.520
I hope you'll hold the Kongpurim family accountable

302
34:58.907 --> 35:00.440
to the same standards.

303
35:39.336 --> 35:40.337
Honey!

304
35:40.632 --> 35:42.050
Send someone to help Pakkard! Hurry!

305
35:42.542 --> 35:44.360
They've found Pakkard!

306
35:47.150 --> 35:48.151
Mom!

307
35:49.278 --> 35:52.149
Didn't Pakkard tell me she was fleeing the country?

308
35:52.432 --> 35:55.280
I don't know how they found our safe house!

309
35:55.547 --> 35:57.760
Maybe one of our men let it slip.

310
36:00.760 --> 36:03.160
Honey, please! Do something!

311
36:03.347 --> 36:05.100
Are you just going to let your own niece die?

312
36:06.355 --> 36:07.800
Whatever happens, happens.

313
36:09.156 --> 36:11.560
But if she really does die, all the better.

314
36:14.080 --> 36:15.960
Then taking revenge on the Kongpurim family

315
36:16.861 --> 36:18.762
will be justified in the eyes of our family.

316
36:22.700 --> 36:23.701
You fucking...

317
37:00.520 --> 37:02.621
Did you tell your family where Pakkard was hiding?

318
37:15.267 --> 37:17.168
Pakkard really did kill Yi.

319
37:20.603 --> 37:22.200
She has to face the consequences of what she did.

320
37:27.963 --> 37:29.360
I never should've trusted you.

321
37:53.291 --> 37:56.120
Didn't you say our families couldn't tear us apart?

322
37:57.883 --> 37:58.884
Huh?

323
38:01.131 --> 38:04.480
Didn't you say they couldn't hurt us?

324
38:10.563 --> 38:12.400
But we can't move forward like this, either!

325
38:14.152 --> 38:16.200
What? Move forward with what?

326
38:17.475 --> 38:20.160
The past is still unresolved! Things still haven't been made right!

327
38:20.176 --> 38:21.280
We can't move forward.

328
38:24.901 --> 38:26.500
You might not know this,

329
38:28.200 --> 38:30.101
but the reason Yi killed Wirat

330
38:32.019 --> 38:33.880
was because he murdered my mother!

331
38:36.664 --> 38:37.680
What do you mean?

332
38:41.320 --> 38:44.640
Your uncle was the one who started all of this.

333
38:50.456 --> 38:52.680
If you're saying Pakkard had her reasons,

334
38:55.163 --> 38:56.640
then so did my brother.

335
39:09.020 --> 39:11.560
I was foolish enough to think you were different from them.

336
39:14.627 --> 39:17.200
But you know what? You're becoming the kind of adult we both hate.

337
39:23.900 --> 39:26.000
If you choose to be like the rest of the Kongpurim family,

338
39:31.401 --> 39:32.640
then don't ever come see me again.

339
39:41.280 --> 39:42.650
What are you two doing here?

340
39:49.832 --> 39:51.700
It's not like I want to be here, either.

341
39:52.664 --> 39:53.665
Excuse me.

342
39:53.827 --> 39:56.400
Things might not be as you think.

343
40:00.435 --> 40:01.920
I guess it's time

344
40:02.152 --> 40:03.880
I told you the truth

345
40:04.320 --> 40:05.651
about how all of this started.

346
40:06.408 --> 40:07.409
It all began with love.

347
40:20.232 --> 40:21.920
17 years ago,

348
40:22.344 --> 40:26.000
the two families were fiercely competing for a port concession.

349
40:26.760 --> 40:29.600
A worker from the Monchaikul family was shot dead,

350
40:30.091 --> 40:31.880
and no one knew who was responsible.

351
40:32.971 --> 40:33.972
What should we do, boss?

352
40:34.624 --> 40:35.625
Listen.

353
40:36.091 --> 40:39.720
Call that military officer you know and have him deal with those damn Kongpurims!

354
40:40.374 --> 40:42.320
We can't just let our men die like this!

355
40:43.480 --> 40:45.640
Take care of it quietly.

356
40:45.877 --> 40:47.960
Don't let it affect the port concession.

357
40:51.179 --> 40:52.360
Stay out of this.

358
40:53.854 --> 40:55.486
Is this why

359
40:56.179 --> 40:57.180
you won't go after that family?

360
40:57.918 --> 41:01.240
Wiboon believed Wirat was going soft because of his love

361
41:01.374 --> 41:04.560
for his first love, Sirin, Tokyo's mother.

362
41:05.125 --> 41:07.200
Come on, be realistic!

363
41:07.350 --> 41:10.406
You have a child, and she has a family of her own!

364
41:10.619 --> 41:13.040
Why the hell are you still hung up on your first love? Huh?

365
41:13.462 --> 41:15.680
- Face reality! - Yeah, I get it!

366
41:18.264 --> 41:20.040
Just do as I say.

367
41:20.963 --> 41:21.964
Stay out of it.

368
41:26.416 --> 41:30.800
Wiboon still wanted his brother to lead the family business.

369
41:39.360 --> 41:42.120
My brother was blinded by love

370
41:42.832 --> 41:45.440
and was ready to abandon everything our family had built

371
41:46.272 --> 41:47.720
to start a new life.

372
41:48.518 --> 41:51.360
He had no idea that his actions

373
41:51.856 --> 41:54.040
would make everything our family had worked for

374
41:54.720 --> 41:55.800
go to waste.

375
41:56.700 --> 41:58.001
So what are you going to do, son?

376
41:59.363 --> 42:00.364
I'll do

377
42:01.523 --> 42:02.880
what I have to do.

378
42:07.752 --> 42:10.050
Wiboon was the mastermind behind it all.

379
42:11.753 --> 42:13.360
He made Mr. Po believe

380
42:13.490 --> 42:16.400
that Wirat had plotted to deceive Sirin and kill her.

381
42:26.502 --> 42:27.503
Sirin!

382
42:32.992 --> 42:33.993
Yeah.

383
42:35.166 --> 42:39.120
And that was the beginning of an endless cycle of revenge.

384
43:20.790 --> 43:22.320
Sometimes, the truth hurts.

385
43:23.867 --> 43:25.734
But if we refuse to accept it,

386
43:26.411 --> 43:28.250
we'll never be able to make things right.

387
43:39.707 --> 43:41.440
What the father said makes sense.

388
43:46.587 --> 43:48.320
I guess there's really no way to fix things anymore.

389
43:52.774 --> 43:53.880
Because the Kongpurim

390
43:55.419 --> 43:56.700
and Monchaikul families

391
43:58.480 --> 44:00.040
will never be able to reconcile.

392
44:33.808 --> 44:34.809
You bitch!

393
44:51.560 --> 44:53.280
- [Next Episode Preview] - After everything I've done to raise you,

394
44:54.440 --> 44:56.846
is this how you repay me, huh?

395
44:57.360 --> 44:58.561
If you're going to shoot Pakkard,

396
44:59.189 --> 45:00.480
you'll have to kill me first.

397
45:01.335 --> 45:03.800
No matter who tells us what we should do,

398
45:03.840 --> 45:05.840
we're the ones who make our own choices, right?

399
45:07.720 --> 45:09.160
I'm a Kongpurim,

400
45:09.824 --> 45:11.760
and you're a Monchaikul.

401
45:12.200 --> 45:13.560
But if I choose you,

402
45:14.059 --> 45:15.300
will you choose me?
